WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Know your customers. Start with a real customer problem.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Ask and listen. How do customers solve this problem today?

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Define the benefit. Explain why your solution helps them.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Put it into practice. Speak to three potential customers this week.

